{"title":"마남 이치 [단행본]","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=n4rLi/dJMcabzs7Wq/xvOpzBYiw8QonoDyI0r7rk&filename=th3","synopsis":"이 세계에서 마법이란 생물이다.\n그리고 험난한 시련을 극복해, 마법을 습득한 헌터를 사람들은 「마녀」라 부른다.\n어느 날, 변경의 깊은 산속에서 무시무시한 왕의 마법 킹 우로로와 최강의 마녀가 격투를 벌이고 있었다.\n그런데 그때, 그런 상황과 어울리지 않는 한 소년이 난입한다.\n그 소년의 이름은 이치.\n마녀나 마법과는 아무런 인연이 없는 산속 사냥꾼이 세계의 상식을 뒤엎기 시작한다! MADAN NO ICHI © 2024 by Osamu Nishi, Shiro Usazaki/SHUEISHA Inc.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-11-07","rank":163,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-11-08","rank":223,"change":{"type":"down","amount":60}},{"date":"2026-11-09","rank":288,"change":{"type":"down","amount":65}},{"date":"2026-11-12","rank":299,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-11-13","rank":285,"change":{"type":"up","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-11-14","rank":271,"change":{"type":"up","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-11-15","rank":225,"change":{"type":"up","amount":46}},{"date":"2026-11-16","rank":281,"change":{"type":"down","amount":56}},{"date":"2026-11-21","rank":294,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-11-22","rank":263,"change":{"type":"up","amount":31}},{"date":"2026-11-28","rank":284,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-11-07","rank":251,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-11-08","rank":245,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-11-09","rank":245,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-11-10","rank":239,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-11-11","rank":239,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-11-12","rank":228,"change":{"type":"up","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-11-13","rank":228,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}}],"monthly":[]},"viewSeries":[],"metricsSeries":[{"date":"2026-11-26","v":2373,"rc":13,"rs":130,"cc":8},{"date":"2026-11-27","v":2393,"rc":13,"rs":130,"cc":8},{"date":"2026-11-28","v":2394,"rc":13,"rs":130,"cc":8}]}